  "about": "Riven's catalogue (catalogue-v1): every block the generator places, one entry each, with one id every definition can name. An id is its kind, or the kind, a dot and a name (rock.gabbro). block lists candidate block states (modid:block or modid:block[property=value,...]); the first that resolves wins, so later candidates are the stand-ins. terrain names the generator's TerrainBlock the entry stands for while the generator still uses that enum.",
