  "contract": [
    "The catalogue is the generator's vocabulary: definitions are to name entries by id, never block names. An id's prefix is its kind; every tag is declared in tags. Each entry resolves to its first candidate whose block is registered and whose properties fit it. Every TerrainBlock has exactly one entry."
  ]
